To remove the inconvenience caused by incompatible uuencode/decode
programs on some target machines, the PC binaries packages on linc
are now in their binary form (i.e., the previous packages were
uudecoded).

Please make sure to use BINARY mode to transfer them all the way down
to your PC (this includes the "text" files, which are in DOS format).

